                        "entry_id": "f94bc183-2c33-301e-9907-d0e9be4aea16",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "admixtures"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "04d3bb36-7ff5-311f-8e06-1817be9193d5",
                        "entry_id": "f94bc183-2c33-301e-9907-d0e9be4aea16",
                        "glosses": [
                            "混合"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a4162654-1d7b-4dd9-952f-2d6de8bb9dd1",
                                "sense_id": "04d3bb36-7ff5-311f-8e06-1817be9193d5",
                                "text": "The admixture of vanilla extract in the dough improved the pastries' flavor.",
                                "translation": "在面团中加入香草精可以改善糕点的风味。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5e42d8eb-fceb-4a10-a3ca-7393e29d7e9e",
                                "sense_id": "04d3bb36-7ff5-311f-8e06-1817be9193d5",
                                "text": "[Penelope and Euryclea] express their feelings in copious direct discourse. Feelings though they are, with only a slight admixture of the most general considerations upon human destiny, the syntactical connection between part and part is perfectly clear, no contour is blurred.",
                                "translation": "佩涅洛佩和欧律克勒亚用大量的直接引语表达了她们的感受。尽管她们的感受仅仅是情感的流露，其中只略微掺杂了一些关于人类命运的普遍思考，但各部分之间的句法联系却非常清晰，没有任何模糊之处。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c74fc03d-e3ad-4c35-a010-e3d991bc925d",
                                "sense_id": "04d3bb36-7ff5-311f-8e06-1817be9193d5",
                                "text": "Gas analysis of blood samples, obtained from different sites in the heart and great vessels, permits demonstration of admixture of oxygenated blood in the venous side or admixture of venous blood in the arterial side of the circulation.",
                                "translation": "对从心脏和大血管不同部位采集的血液样本进行气体分析，可以证明循环系统中静脉侧是否存在含氧血液的混合，或者动脉侧是否存在静脉血的混合。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "492c290d-9a5c-488a-bd58-f723e10db578",
                                "sense_id": "04d3bb36-7ff5-311f-8e06-1817be9193d5",
                                "text": "Both were lean, raw-boned specimens; the man tall, sandy, and grey-eyed, and the woman short and rather dark, with a black straightness of hair suggesting a slight Indian admixture.",
                                "translation": "两人都是瘦削、骨骼粗壮的体型；男子身材高挑，皮肤呈沙色，眼睛呈灰色；女子身材矮小，肤色较深，一头乌黑笔直的头发表明她可能略带印度血统。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7a49149a-f186-38eb-9b7c-9c83e45054cf",
